  "bodyHash": "93a57ccdc12d72f9",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8b6d60a8-c4e0-4461-a748-379b08a9ef7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">截至上次更新為止，這是對 GamingWithJen 的巨型房屋（使用與原版不同的種子）最精準的還原作品。</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_543e10a2-ac13-4691-8aa4-e5461318dc02.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4ad10482-d92b-471d-a9fc-649259ed3118.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">你進入的第一個房間是客廳。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_abeceafc-3a05-4d66-a64b-f444c96d7721.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">從這裡你可以通往 Jen 的房間、附魔室和廚房</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c174e97e-d0c9-4c25-a813-3c053b87340d.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_819a066b-a56e-4ca3-b994-dcee34eef3f5.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_526245c1-80fc-4753-b6b6-f83b8b60e791.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">從廚房可以通往二樓區域，進而進入多個房間。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_acec19dc-35e7-467e-ada7-bc808c03cf2c.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">我就不詳細介紹各個可探索的地點了，以免破壞大家的體驗！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">製作這座還原建築總共花了大約兩週時間，其中大部分時間都在處理室內細節（裝飾頭像、盔甲架等）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">房屋周圍的大部分景觀（山丘、沙漠生態域等）其實都是假的，也就是說我是用 WorldEdit 製作的。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">我必須承認原創者的貢獻，以下是我在製作這座近乎一比一還原的建築時所參考的影片（當然也做了一些調整）。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OXkZsYjWhso\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zfyU_tUUIdY?si=GFghciUGuigRE8cS\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/paiWrr52gEc\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">為了還原 GamingWithJen 和 PopularMMOs 的原版影片內容，我基本上是一幀一幀地對比兩部影片，以求達到最精準的效果！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">如果你們喜歡我的作品，歡迎訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道或在 Patreon 上支持我！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">也請留言告訴我你們的意見或遇到的問題，我會盡可能回覆每一位玩家 ;)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@Skyuten\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUP_fMnMIZ36zlZ8nt3ozwg?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white&label=Skyuten&labelColor=#000000&color=#FF0000&link=https://www.youtube.com/@Skyuten\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道訂閱數\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Skyuten\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api/?username=Skyuten&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=#FFFFFF&labelColor=#000000&color=#d3d3d3&link=https://patreon.com/Skyuten?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" alt=\"Patreon 贊助者徽章\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
